@@ -1644,8 +1644,22 @@ Use Square's sandbox if you can: in your Square developer dashboard open your ap
 6. Make a sale of one item and pay by cash. Pass: the sale completes. In Square (Dashboard, Orders or Transactions) the order is there with the item, and a payment of the same amount.
 7. Make a sale with the card reader if it is paired, or by gift card or exchange credit. Pass: the order in Square shows the payment as external.
